<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="source sans pro">Hi {!Contact.Name},</font><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">The pricing on your purchase order does not match our system price, please adjust your records to reflect this current pricing. Your Order is not on hold and is moving through our system. Any changes to your order could result in changes to this pricing.</span><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><ul><li><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">PO Number:&nbsp;</span><font face="source sans pro">{!EBS_Order__c.Customer_PO__c}</font></li><li>Order Number:&nbsp;<font face="source sans pro" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!EBS_Order__c.EBS_Order_Number__c}</font></li></ul><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">Please follow the below link for more information:</span><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="source sans pro">{!EBS_Order__c.Tracking_Link_Formula__c}</font><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">All the best,<br>The Koozie Group Customer Care Krew<br></p><a href="https://www.kooziegroup.com/US/" style="color: rgb(69, 111, 178); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-decoration-line: none;">kooziegroup.com</a><br>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>